%%label III. Largo
%%note D minor. A chorale for the strings alone; a lament for the oboe under high held violins; the chorale in the full orchestra at the climax; the flute remembers the lament, and the movement ends on a quiet D major chord.
X:1
T:Shostakovich’s Missing Symphony
T:III. Largo
C:Lor, in the manner of Shostakovich
M:4/4
L:1/8
Q:"Largo" 1/4=52
%%score [fl ob cl bn] [hn tp tb] tm xy [v1 v2 va vc cb]
% The score is written at sounding pitch. Dynamics in the wind, brass and double-bass parts are set one to three levels below the strings to balance the playback samples of this site; they are a playback compromise, not dynamics for live players.
